    <p><?php echo _('Company Directory is a protected singleton shortcut inside this Services menu. Hiding it disables that menu subscription while retaining the internal route; the native Directory button and the Yealink/Grandstream downloaded phonebook keep working. Phone Information is generated live from the requesting phone, site, model, group, template and last-applied state, so its body is intentionally not editable; its label, order, visibility and targets are editable. The small number under the arrows is only its menu-order slot, not a service ID or feature code.'); ?></p>
    <p class="help-block"><?php echo _('You can publish vendor-XML menus, read-only notices, validated one-touch dial entries and the managed directory shortcut. Modern Cisco XML phones can render the supported Menu/Text/Directory objects and Execute dial actions; Cisco 7940/7960 can show the menu and text but require manual dialing. These are not arbitrary HTML pages: the module does not run JavaScript, PHP, shell commands or third-party server scripts from a service definition. A voicemail browser is not implemented.'); ?></p>
  </section>

  <section class="ucm-card">
    <div class="ucm-card-heading"><div><h3><?php echo _('Published catalog'); ?></h3><p><?php echo _('Directory and Phone Information are protected singleton routes, but either may be hidden. Use the arrow controls to publish one deterministic order on every phone.'); ?></p></div><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="ucm-service-add"><i class="fa fa-plus"></i> <?php echo _('Add service'); ?></button></div>
    <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-striped" id="ucm-services-table"><thead><tr><th title="<?php echo _('Numeric position used to sort the Services menu'); ?>"><?php echo _('Order slot'); ?></th><th><?php echo _('Service'); ?></th><th><?php echo _('Type'); ?></th><th><?php echo _('Phone targets'); ?></th><th><?php echo _('State'); ?></th><th><?php echo _('Phone result'); ?></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
  </section>

  <section class="ucm-card" id="ucm-service-editor" style="display:none">
    <div class="ucm-card-heading"><div><h3 id="ucm-service-editor-title"><?php echo _('Add phone service'); ?></h3><p><?php echo _('Dial destinations accept digits, star, hash and normal dial-string punctuation only. They make the phone dial; they never run a shell or arbitrary Asterisk command.'); ?></p></div></div>
    <form id="ucm-service-form"><input type="hidden" name="id"><input type="hidden" name="locked" value="0"><input type="hidden" name="locked_service_type" value="">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4"><div class="form-group"><label><?php echo _('Menu label'); ?></label><input class="form-control" name="name" maxlength="48" required></div></div>
        <div class="col-md-3"><div class="form-group"><label><?php echo _('Stable key'); ?> <i class="fa fa-question-circle" title="Used in phone URLs. It cannot change after creation."></i></label><input class="form-control" name="service_key" pattern="[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,47}" placeholder="it-help"></div></div>
        <div class="col-md-3"><div class="form-group"><label><?php echo _('Purpose'); ?></label><select class="form-control" name="service_type"><option value="diallist"><?php echo _('Quick-dial list'); ?></option><option value="text"><?php echo _('Read-only notice'); ?></option></select><input class="form-control" id="ucm-service-protected-purpose" readonly style="display:none"><p class="help-block" id="ucm-service-type-help"><?php echo _('Only Quick-dial and Notice services can be added. Edit the existing protected rows to change their label, order, visibility or phone targets.'); ?></p></div></div>
        <div class="col-md-1"><div class="form-group"><label><?php echo _('Order'); ?></label><input class="form-control" type="number" name="menu_order" min="0" max="999" value="50"></div></div>
        <div class="col-md-1"><div class="checkbox" style="margin-top:28px"><label title="<?php echo _('Show this subscription in the phone Services menu'); ?>"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="1" checked> <?php echo _('Publish'); ?></label></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group"><label><?php echo _('Phone families'); ?></label><div>
        <label class="checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" class="ucm-service-format" value="cisco"> <?php echo _('Cisco XML'); ?></label>
        <label class="checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" class="ucm-service-format" value="cisco_legacy"> <?php echo _('Cisco 7940/7960'); ?></label>
